# Local development defaults for `make run`.
# Exported shell variables still take precedence over values in this file.
# Keep the runtime DSN pointed at `controlhub`; `controlhub_v1` is preserve-only fallback after local bigint cutover.
APP_ENV=local
APP_PORT=8080
DATABASE_DSN=controlhub:controlhub_dev@tcp(127.0.0.1:3306)/controlhub?parseTime=true&charset=utf8mb4
# JWT_SECRET is required; startup rejects blank or placeholder values.
# Generate a real one with:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
# Then paste the output here and uncomment:
# JWT_SECRET=<generated-hex-value>
# The <generated-hex-value> above is a marker, not a secret: startup refuses
# the literal marker (case-insensitively), so an unedited uncomment can't boot.
